      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 701,
        "text": "They don’t know what we were together, you and I, despite everything. And that “despite everything” that was so exhausting, so painful, so hard. Melanie, they can never know that we two, despite everything, liked to think of ourselves as a simple song."
